<title>NORWAY: Norway's January C/A surplus NOK 9.25 bln. [CORRECTED 08:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>Norway's January C/A surplus NOK 9.25 bln. [CORRECTED 08:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator: CURRENT ACCOUNT (billions of crowns)</p>
<p>					January 1997	 January 1996</p>
<p> Balance				 9.25		     7.66</p>
<p> Goods/Services		     11.5			8.5</p>
<p>(Corrects 1997 figure from 30.10 and 1996 figure from 25.10.)</p>
<p> Interest/others		    -2.2		     -0.69</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, + 47 22 42 50 41</p>
